    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 635,
      "topLeftY": 62,
      "bottomRightX": 664,
      "bottomRightY": 78,
      "content": "2.10",
      "type": "header"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 88,
      "topLeftY": 126,
      "bottomRightX": 366,
      "bottomRightY": 147,
      "content": "## 1 *Use of the Present perfect tense*",
      "type": "title"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 85,
      "topLeftY": 158,
      "bottomRightX": 490,
      "bottomRightY": 178,
      "content": "Use the Present perfect tense to describe the present situation.",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 88,
      "topLeftY": 188,
      "bottomRightX": 609,
      "bottomRightY": 206,
      "content": "**Example:** The worst hurricane in living memory **has caused** terrible damage.",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 88,
      "topLeftY": 226,
      "bottomRightX": 338,
      "bottomRightY": 246,
      "content": "## 2 *Use of the Past simple tense*",
      "type": "title"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 85,
      "topLeftY": 260,
      "bottomRightX": 496,
      "bottomRightY": 297,
      "content": "Use the Past simple tense to describe something that happened at a known time. Use adverbs to say when the event happened.",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 88,
      "topLeftY": 309,
      "bottomRightX": 483,
      "bottomRightY": 327,
      "content": "**Example:** The storm **hit** the area late on Tuesday evening.",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 88,
      "topLeftY": 343,
      "bottomRightX": 362,
      "bottomRightY": 364,
      "content": "## 3 *Prepositions in relative clauses*",
      "type": "title"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 88,
      "topLeftY": 376,
      "bottomRightX": 415,
      "bottomRightY": 397,
      "content": "- * Relative clauses giving necessary information",
      "type": "list"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 88,
      "topLeftY": 409,
      "bottomRightX": 441,
      "bottomRightY": 448,
      "content": "**Example:** The house is very old. I used to live in it.\nThe house **I used to live in** is very old.",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 85,
      "topLeftY": 448,
      "bottomRightX": 455,
      "bottomRightY": 466,
      "content": "**Note:** The preposition is at the end of the relative clause.",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 88,
      "topLeftY": 484,
      "bottomRightX": 421,
      "bottomRightY": 504,
      "content": "- * Relative clauses giving additional information.",
      "type": "list"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 88,
      "topLeftY": 517,
      "bottomRightX": 625,
      "bottomRightY": 593,
      "content": "**Example:** Sana'a Secondary School is one of the biggest schools in the country.\nI went to it when I was younger.\nSana'a Secondary School, **to which I went when I was younger**,\nis one of the biggest schools in the country.",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 85,
      "topLeftY": 593,
      "bottomRightX": 586,
      "bottomRightY": 630,
      "content": "**Note:** The preposition is at the beginning of the relative clause. The clause is written between commas.",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 88,
      "topLeftY": 649,
      "bottomRightX": 360,
      "bottomRightY": 669,
      "content": "## 4 *Adverbs and adverbial phrases*",
      "type": "title"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 85,
      "topLeftY": 683,
      "bottomRightX": 303,
      "bottomRightY": 701,
      "content": "These tell us more about actions.",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 88,
      "topLeftY": 710,
      "bottomRightX": 583,
      "bottomRightY": 767,
      "content": "**Examples:** (How) People stood around **silently**.\n(Where) **In the countryside** whole villages have disappeared.\n(When) The storm hit the area **late on Tuesday evening**.",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 83,
      "topLeftY": 774,
      "bottomRightX": 607,
      "bottomRightY": 794,
      "content": "**Find other examples of the above language points in the texts.**",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 83,
      "topLeftY": 808,
      "bottomRightX": 470,
      "bottomRightY": 828,
